      "role_note": "terminal (Onda) — enable fuzzy and show a false positive",
      "narration_text": "Now turn on allow-fuzzy and show a false positive. Ask Claude to add rapidfuzz to the unmatched rows with a similarity threshold of eighty-eight, printing every proposed match as 'needs human confirmation' with the score. Then deliberately show one false positive: two genuinely different firms with similar names. That false positive is why fuzzy matching must never run without a human sign-off.",
